Now I understand the core mechanism. Let me think about the concurrency properties of the new `_persist` implementation:

```dart
Future<void> _persist() {
  final inFlight = _persistPass;
  if (inFlight != null) {
    _persistDirty = true;
    return inFlight;
  }
  return _persistPass = _persistLoop();
}

Future<void> _persistLoop() async {
  try {
    do {
      _persistDirty = false;
      await _persistUnchecked();
